* gf180mcu resistor flavour menu: R, sheet resistance, TC, bias dependence
* Issue #4 - template; resistors/run.sh substitutes @TOKENS@ and runs the deck.
*
* Each instance is driven by an ideal current source so R = V(node)/I directly.
* Two geometries per flavour share w=1u (l=10u and l=50u) so an effective sheet
* resistance can be extracted by the two-length method
*     Rsh = (R(l2) - R(l1)) / ((l2 - l1)/w)
* which cancels the head/terminal resistance the subcircuits add at each end.
* The extra rows at 50 uA (vs the 1 uA reference) probe bias dependence: the
* gf180mcu resistor cards all carry r_vc1 = r_vc2 = 0, so this is a check that
* the deck sees no voltage coefficient, not a measurement of one.
* Bulk terminal: p-substrate (0 V) for poly, n+ diffusion and nwell; the nwell
* rail for the p+ diffusion resistor, so its body junction stays reverse biased.
*
.include @MODELS@/design.ngspice
.lib @MODELS@/sm141064.ngspice @RESLIB@
.options temp=@TEMP@

vnw vnw 0 dc 3.3

x1 n1 0 0 ppolyf_u_1k r_width=1u r_length=10u
i1 0 n1 dc 1u
x2 n2 0 0 ppolyf_u_1k r_width=1u r_length=50u
i2 0 n2 dc 1u
x3 n3 0 0 ppolyf_u_1k r_width=2u r_length=20u
i3 0 n3 dc 1u
x4 n4 0 0 ppolyf_u_1k r_width=5u r_length=50u
i4 0 n4 dc 1u
x5 n5 0 0 ppolyf_u_1k r_width=1u r_length=50u
i5 0 n5 dc 50u

x6 n6 0 0 ppolyf_u_2k r_width=1u r_length=10u
i6 0 n6 dc 1u
x7 n7 0 0 ppolyf_u_2k r_width=1u r_length=50u
i7 0 n7 dc 1u
x8 n8 0 0 ppolyf_u_2k r_width=2u r_length=20u
i8 0 n8 dc 1u
x9 n9 0 0 ppolyf_u_2k r_width=5u r_length=50u
i9 0 n9 dc 1u
x10 n10 0 0 ppolyf_u_2k r_width=1u r_length=50u
i10 0 n10 dc 50u

x11 n11 0 0 ppolyf_u_3k r_width=1u r_length=10u
i11 0 n11 dc 1u
x12 n12 0 0 ppolyf_u_3k r_width=1u r_length=50u
i12 0 n12 dc 1u
